# Classifying an enumerated set of colors
#
# A class is defined by a list containing red, green, and blue. An explicit
# N3 rule enumerates that list and derives a class membership for every
# listed color.

@prefix : <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#> .
@prefix log: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/log#> .

# Sample data
:PrimaryColour owl:oneOf (:red :green :blue) .

# Inference rules
@prefix list: <http://www.w3.org/2000/10/swap/list#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

{
    ?C owl:oneOf ?L .
    ?X list:in ?L
} => {
    ?X a ?C
} .
